@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# Set token in your HTTP client's secret store; never commit a real token.
@token = REEMPLAZAR_LOCALMENTE

### Public healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Profile creation after Supabase Auth signup/login; fictitious example data
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombres":"Ejemplo","apellidos":"Prueba","tipoDocumento":"DNI","documento":"00000000"}

### Own profile (masked document)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch permitted fields; null/omitted fields remain unchanged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"telefono":"+51900000000"}

### Public active catalogues: IDs below must come from these endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/distritos

### Active barrier types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/tipos-barrera

### Create report; fictitious text/location, replace catalogue IDs and local photo path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=hu01

--hu01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="datos"
Content-Type: application/json

{"tipoBarreraId":1,"severidadDeclarada":"ALTA","descripcion":"Rampa rota de prueba","distritoId":1,"direccionReferencia":"Dirección ficticia","latitud":-16.3989,"longitud":-71.5350}
--hu01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="foto"; filename="evidencia.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./evidencia-local.png
--hu01--

### Report detail: replace ID with the 201 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Own reports: newest first; date boundaries are inclusive in America/Lima
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes?limite=20&estado=RECIBIDO&severidadDeclarada=ALTA&desde=2026-10-01&hasta=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Own report by exact code; no results if it belongs to another citizen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes?codigo=ARQ-2026-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page: replace cursor with siguienteCursor; keep the same filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes?limite=20&cursor=PEGAR_CURSOR_DE_RESPUESTA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Private evidence: use the link from detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes/1/fotos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Chronological report history: owner or administrator; same 404 for foreign/missing reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reportes/1/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Administrative global collection; requires a real provisioned administrator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reportes?limite=20&estado=RECIBIDO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start evaluation; reload current state before retrying after 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reportes/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estadoEsperado":"RECIBIDO","nuevoEstado":"EN_EVALUACION","motivo":"Inicio de revisión del reporte"}

### Admin user directory; masked document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/usuarios?limite=20&estadoCuenta=ACTIVA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard: aggregates for reports created during the inclusive local date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/resumen?desde=2026-10-01&hasta=2026-10-31&distritoId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard: all reports, no personal data or photos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/resumen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Account state: replace UUID with an actual user from the directory; never suspend yourself
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/usuarios/REEMPLAZAR_UUID/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estadoEsperado":"ACTIVA","nuevoEstado":"SUSPENDIDA","motivo":"Revisión interna autorizada por el responsable"}
